{"games":[{"id":110603239367459,"name":"FUNHOUSE (PLAYTEST)","desc":"(This is pre-pre-alpha bugs can still be present rn)\nThe show never ends in purgatory.\n\nFUNHOUSE is a roguelike game, directed and developed by VibingLeaf, Yoonie (Zvmbiegerl) and Nullkitz.\nEach playable character features a distinct gameplay style and set of abilities to contribute to the team.\n\nCurrently, this game is in a DEMO state, meaning very few of the characters from the roster are present, and a lot more is planned for this game. A story mode is planned as well, but for now we have endless mode.\n\nKEEP IN MIND: GAME IS SUBJECT TO BUGS, REPORT IF FOUND ANY\nAND WE ACTIVELY LOOK FOR YOUR FEEDBACK!","path":"/game/110603239367459-funhouse","slug":"110603239367459-funhouse","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a5a434920640442e79f7e235c9a72307dcc6e8b4df95d386b47df7509a1a661d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-cdec320cd4548fdb933d1b92e610cabf/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":34,"visitor":3937463,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-04T08:18:03.126Z","creator":{"name":"Team FUNHOUSE","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":83313403604499,"name":"✨ Noob Empire","desc":"💸 Build your army of noobs\n🛠️ Unlock structures and upgrades\n✨ Control noobs and fight in combat!\n\n🤑 Your noobs work offline. Come back to collect your earnings!\n\nThe game is a work in progress, so your feedback is appreciated!\nLeave a like on the game for more updates 👍","path":"/game/83313403604499-noob-empire","slug":"83313403604499-noob-empire","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e781e924422342bb7cc341cda66747fec92b1be5d1dcbf701deed180ea2952f6.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e91e572338a50718fc71267f10db5225/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":34,"visitor":24330091,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-27T18:52:11.204Z","creator":{"name":"Levrone group","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"